          <li>
            <foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
              <def>Deity</def>
              <place>AturaStation</place>
              <deities />
            </foundation>
            <name>Unity Commune</name>
            <adjective>authoritarian</adjective>
            <memberName>Citizen</memberName>
            <leaderTitleMale>First President for Life</leaderTitleMale>
            <leaderTitleFemale>First President for Life</leaderTitleFemale>
            <description>"The sales agent stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with an assault rifle. The people were shocked, but I explained that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. It is not enough to set our goal. It must be pursued with constancy and sacrifice."

  - Alex 'Gundozer' Boyle, on a political Address on the canyon</description>
            <descriptionTemplate>"The sales agent stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with an assault rifle. The people were shocked, but I explained that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. It is not enough to set our goal. It must be pursued with constancy and sacrifice."

  - Alex 'Gundozer' Boyle, on a political Address on the canyon</descriptionTemplate>
