            <name>Way of Power</name>
            <adjective>powerist</adjective>
            <memberName>Poweror</memberName>
            <leaderTitleMale>Wise Ruler</leaderTitleMale>
            <leaderTitleFemale>Wise Ruler</leaderTitleFemale>
            <description>Truth can be found in all religions and ideologies, as they are all part of the greater human experience. Whether it is the teachings of the Confucianist texts or the philosophies of the ancient Anarchist scholars, we can learn about the universe by opening our minds to this truth. Only through carefully studying all beliefs can we truly understand the nature of reality.</description>
            <descriptionTemplate>Truth can be found in all religions and ideologies, as they are all part of the greater human experience. Whether it is the teachings of the Confucianist texts or the philosophies of the ancient Anarchist scholars, we can learn about the universe by opening our minds to this truth. Only through carefully studying all beliefs can we truly understand the nature of reality.</descriptionTemplate>
            <culture>Rustican</culture>
            <iconDef>SpikeyE</iconDef>
            <colorDef>Purple</colorDef>
            <primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.070, 0.443, 0.947, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
            <memes>
              <li>Supremacist</li>
            </memes>
