          <li>
            <foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
              <def>Deity</def>
              <place>Boccocarro</place>
              <deities />
            </foundation>
            <name>Womanly Extreme-Gelug</name>
            <adjective>Extreme-Gelugist</adjective>
            <memberName>Extreme-Gelugist</memberName>
            <leaderTitleMale>Bodhi Chief</leaderTitleMale>
            <leaderTitleFemale>Bodhi Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
            <description>Mabra 'Scorpion' Tranca was a renowned philosopher, her name heard all across the stars. She posited that life is too short to be lived without enjoying oneself, and that only by extolling the virtues of a party life can one hope to be truly fulfilled. The male believers boasted and fought, so Scorpion cast them out of the council of leaders. The believers moved between cities and institutions, spreading word of the new order and fighting against those who would disagree.</description>
            <descriptionTemplate>Mabra 'Scorpion' Tranca was a renowned philosopher, her name heard all across the stars. She posited that life is too short to be lived without enjoying oneself, and that only by extolling the virtues of a party life can one hope to be truly fulfilled. The male believers boasted and fought, so Scorpion cast them out of the council of leaders. The believers moved between cities and institutions, spreading word of the new order and fighting against those who would disagree.</descriptionTemplate>
            <culture>Corunan</culture>
            <iconDef>RoundD</iconDef>
            <colorDef>LightMauve</colorDef>
            <primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.913, 0.652, 0.153, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
            <memes>
              <li>Structure_OriginBuddhist</li>
              <li>FemaleSupremacy</li>
            </memes>
