            <leaderTitleFemale>First Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
            <description>"Simplicity, patience, compassion. These three are the greatest treasures. When you are content to be simply yourself and don't compare or compete, everyone will respect you. The truth is not always beautiful, nor beautiful words the truth.."

  - Lao Tzu, Tao Te Ching</description>
            <descriptionTemplate>"Simplicity, patience, compassion. These three are the greatest treasures. When you are content to be simply yourself and don't compare or compete, everyone will respect you. The truth is not always beautiful, nor beautiful words the truth.."

  - Lao Tzu, Tao Te Ching</descriptionTemplate>
            <culture>Corunan</culture>
