          <li>
            <foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
              <def>Deity</def>
              <place>Zoutera</place>
              <deities>
                <li>
                  <name>Supreme Leader</name>
                  <type>Delegate of Eternity</type>
                  <gender>Male</gender>
                  <iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
                </li>
              </deities>
            </foundation>
            <name>Legion of Cult of Personality</name>
            <adjective>totalitarian</adjective>
            <memberName>Subject</memberName>
            <leaderTitleMale>Majestic Boss</leaderTitleMale>
            <leaderTitleFemale>Majestic Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
            <description>Persecuted and imprisoned, Frances 'Py' Graye boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. Py instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a stampeding herd of ankylosaurs to kill everyone inside. One day while walking the streets, Py was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use.</description>
            <descriptionTemplate>Persecuted and imprisoned, Frances 'Py' Graye boiled with rage. She escaped, formed her gang, and returned to ruin the weak who had taken so much from her. Py instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used a stampeding herd of ankylosaurs to kill everyone inside. One day while walking the streets, Py was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use.</descriptionTemplate>
            <culture>Kriminul</culture>
            <iconDef>SpikeyC</iconDef>
            <colorDef>DarkOlive</colorDef>
            <primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.875, 0.318, 0.511, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
