          <li>
            <foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
              <def>Deity</def>
              <place>Yttak</place>
              <deities />
            </foundation>
            <name>Path of Animism</name>
            <adjective>animist</adjective>
            <memberName>Animist</memberName>
            <leaderTitleMale>Universe Speaker</leaderTitleMale>
            <leaderTitleFemale>Universe Speaker</leaderTitleFemale>
            <description>Spirits infuse all objects around us, and we can absorb these spirits by eating them. There are no spirits as powerful as the ones that inhabit humans. We can absorb the spirit and power of others by consuming their flesh. Our book says that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</description>
            <descriptionTemplate>Spirits infuse all objects around us, and we can absorb these spirits by eating them. There are no spirits as powerful as the ones that inhabit humans. We can absorb the spirit and power of others by consuming their flesh. Our book says that a sleeping traveler from the stars will crash to the earth, and the spirit of the crater will wake the traveller who will raise the last tribe.</descriptionTemplate>
            <culture>Astropolitan</culture>
            <iconDef>TribalD</iconDef>
            <colorDef>LightTeal</colorDef>
            <memes>
              <li>Structure_Animist</li>
              <li>Cannibal</li>
            </memes>
